    {
      "id": "07d77dd5b1aff94b59575c06ffc16f16594ea7be",
      "short_id": "07d77dd5",
      "created_at": "2020-11-30T13:27:58.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "e74b6bdebe4204eeed64ad76830f016121d2471f"
      ],
      "title": "SMC: Add support for SMCD(v2)",
      "message": "SMC: Add support for SMCD(v2)\n\nAdd SMCD(v2) clc proposal/accept/confirm and decline support.\nProposal and decline parsing routines are used by SMC-R and SMC-D(v2).\n\nEnhance the existing SMC-R protocol dissector in such\na generic way that it supports both SMC-R and SMC-D(v2)\nprotocols. These two protocols are similar to each other.\nSMC-D has a version 1 and version 2.\n\nSigned-off-by: Guvenc Gulce <guvenc@linux.ibm.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Guvenc Gulce",
      "author_email": "guvenc@linux.ibm.com",
      "authored_date": "2020-05-03T15:26:45.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2020-11-30T13:27:58.000+00:00",
